 * @section FoundationPublicApiCoverageFunctional Functional
 *
 * | Public API family | Evidence | State |
 * | ----------------- | -------- | ----- |
 * | `Callback<R, Args...>`, `Callback<R>`, `Callback<void, Args...>`, `Callback<void>` canonical forms | Six `CallbackTest` cases plus umbrella-order compilation cases | `BEHAVIOR` + `COMPILE` |
 * | Free/static binding, non-const member binding, const member binding, `IsBound`, `Invoke`, and `Unbind` | `BindsAndUnbindsAFreeFunction`, member, const-member, void, and no-argument cases | `BEHAVIOR` |
 * | Null non-const member instance | `CallbackTest.RejectsNullMemberInstances` | `BEHAVIOR` |
 * | Null free function, null const member instance, and invocation while unbound with exceptions enabled and disabled | `RejectsNullFreeAndConstMemberTargets` and `EmptyInvocationUsesNoExceptionFallbacks`; the separately compiled `FoundationFunctionalExceptionTests` target verifies both throwing forms with `FOUNDATION_EXCEPTIONS=1` | `BEHAVIOR` + `CONFIGURATION` |
