 *
 * | Public API family | Evidence | State |
 * | ----------------- | -------- | ----- |
 * | `Move` | `MoveTest.TransfersAValueToANewObject`, plus use by Containers and Matrix | `BEHAVIOR` |
 * | `Swap` | `SwapTest.ExchangesTwoValues` | `BEHAVIOR` |
