 *
 * @section FoundationPublicApiCoverageTarget Target-only Evidence
 *
 * Native tests cannot execute an AVR or Cortex-M binary. Embedded CI therefore
 * has a narrower but truthful contract: compile Debug and Release with the
 * target toolchain, export the Release package, and inspect an object inside
 * `libFoundation.a` with the matching binutils. Hardware or emulator execution
 * remains part of `VAL-007`, `VAL-008`, and `VAL-009`.
 *
 * @section FoundationPublicApiCoverageNext Prioritized Test Work
 *
 * `TEST-002` and `TEST-003` are complete. TypeTraits required no additional
 * cases because its standard-library and forced-fallback targets already run
 * the same complete conformance suite. `TEST-004` replaced the one-time header
 * audit with the generated `FoundationHeaders.SelfContained` check.
 */
